The Infinix X6525 is a Unisoc UMS9230 (Tiger T606) handset, being ported to a close-to-mainline
kernel. U-Boot is chainloaded from the Android boot partition (<code>boot_a</code>), and the boot and
root filesystems live in the eMMC's <code>cache</code> and <code>userdata</code> partitions. Android's
data is overwritten; its system partition is left alone.

